  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A Reckless Savage voice names three immortal moves made after reading Pursuing Freedom. The third is Internal Breathing Green Fish Transformation, using adaptation Gu as the core. Its lesson is adaptation: if you lack gills, breathe with your mouth; if you lack even a mouth, create a self-circulating internal respiratory system even if that means walking slowly and becoming unlike a human. Triggering all three moves merges them into Incomplete Freedom Transformation.",
      "chapters": [
        1956
      ],
